==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{com|ru|чокнуться|-ый|t1=|t2=}}, itself from {{m|ru|чокаться|tr=}}, utimatly of onomatopoeic origin.

Compare typologically {{m+|en|crackpot}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|чо́кнутый}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|чо́кнутый|adv=чо́кнуто|absn=+}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[crazy]]
# {{lb|ru|figurative}} [[strange]], [[eccentric]]

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-adj|чо́кнутый|a}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|чо́каться|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|чо́кнуться|g=pf}}

